Subject: Extend the pinned official Rust profile to explicit x86_64 ABIv1

What: explicit CPU/SDK/C-driver admission using the existing build, install,
consumer and ABI mechanisms; configure/MetaMake admits x86_64 LLVM/GNU.
Why: qualify mainline x86 without duplicating Jonx's official SDK pipeline.
Base: PR1800 2eb81b402b0d3de6d0b068ce74fdb6eb653f2d60 plus the three
companion PRs pinned in profiles/mainline-official/sources.json.
Runtime: UNTESTED; no historical v11/ARM acceptance is transferred.
Provenance: original John KNIPPER, APL 1.1; adaptations AROS contributors,
APL 1.1. Candidate for upstream, not submitted.

